    8	
    9	## Proposal F1: Persistent Homology of Detrended Prime Gap Sequence
    10	
    11	### Idea
    12	The sequence d_n = p_n - n*ln(n) - n*(ln ln n - 1) has bounded mean (Cramér model).
    13	Treat the trajectory {(n, d_n) : n=1..N} as a point cloud in R^2 and compute its
    14	persistent homology (PH) under the Vietoris-Rips filtration.
    15	
    16	If the persistence diagram is *finitely supported* in some scale band — i.e., only
    17	polylog(N) bars persist beyond noise — then pi(x) admits a polylog-sized topological
    18	fingerprint. The reconstruction map is: persistent bars -> trajectory model -> p_n.
    19	
    20	This connects prime distribution to TDA, which has only been used on Ulam-spiral
    21	visualizations, not on detrended sequences.
    22	
