    ## Methodology
    Ran 9 targeted WebSearch queries across the 10 topic areas. Date filtering on web search is unreliable for the 3-week window, so I cross-referenced returned hits against publication dates. Most engines have not yet indexed late-April 2026 arXiv submissions in depth.
    
