    5	## What Was Tested
    6	Five unconventional approaches: (1) Cipolla residual autoregression, (2) convolution shortcut for pi(x) differences, (3) finite-field lifting (F_q[x] -> Z), (4) compressed sensing on the prime indicator, (5) transfer matrix / partition function approach.
